    {
      "step_id": "tile_data_shape_and_types.s01",
      "type": "explainer",
      "concept_ids": [
        "data.dataset_rows_columns"
      ],
      "eyebrow": "Rows and Columns",
      "title": "A dataset is a table of observations",
      "lede": "Every delivery Kwik Courier makes gets logged in the same way — and that shared structure is what makes it a dataset.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "block_id": "tile_data_shape_and_types.s01.b01",
          "role": "intro",
          "text": "Kwik Courier records every delivery it makes: the order number, the destination city, how long the delivery took, and which driver handled it. Written down together, all of those records form a dataset — a collection of observations that are all recorded on the same set of variables. Every delivery in the batch was captured using the same kinds of information, and that shared structure is what turns a pile of individual facts into one dataset you can work with.",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns#tb1"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns#f1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "block_id": "tile_data_shape_and_types.s01.b02",
          "role": "definition",
          "text": "That information is commonly organised as a table — sometimes called a data matrix — made of rows and columns. Open the Kwik Courier delivery file and you see exactly this: a grid where every delivery has its own line, and every piece of information about a delivery has its own column. The table below shows the first few deliveries.",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns#tb2"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "data.dataset_rows_columns#f2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "data_table",
          "block_id": "tile_data_shape_and_types.s01.b03",
          "asset_ref": {
            "asset_id": "ds_courier_orders_base",
            "variant_id": null,
            "columns": [
              "order_id",
              "city",
              "delivery_min",
              "driver"
            ],
            "max_rows": 4
          },
          "caption": "Kwik Courier delivery orders — each row is one delivery, each column is one attribute.",
          "highlight": [
            {
              "target": {
                "kind": "row",
